problem_statement:
Qt backend: Escape does not close PopupWindow
### Bug Description

The escape key should close a PopupWindow. It does with winit and WASM, but nothing happens with the Qt backend.

### Reproducible Code (if applicable)

```slint
export component AppWindow inherits Window {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;

    popup := PopupWindow {
        Rectangle {
            background: yellow;
        }

        x: 10px;
        y: 10px;
        height: 50px;
        width: 50px;
    }


    TouchArea {
        clicked => {
            popup.show();
        }
    }
}
```


### Environment Details

- Slint Version: 1.9.1
- Platform/OS: Linux
- Backend/Renderer: Qt


### Product Impact

_No response_

