```
PATCH /collections/test
{
    "optimizers_config": {
        "max_optimization_threads": 2
    }
}
```

when run this to set it `null` again the value doesn't change (without any error or complain):

```
PATCH /collections/test
{
    "optimizers_config": {
        "max_optimization_threads": null
    }
}
```

qdrant version : 1.12.1

